  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>According to Ampere&#39;s law,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8750;</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mo>d</mo><mover><mi>l</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>i</mi></math></p><p>Inside the hollow cylinder, current will be zero. Therefore, magnetic field will also be zero.</p><p>Outside the cylinder,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>i</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8733;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>r</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence, the correct answer is D.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
